# Role
You are a professional services content strategist. You analyze an institution / partner / provider and produce structured metadata.

## Task
Analyze the given institution and provide institution data, doctors and services.

## Name
%%NAME%%

## Details
%%DETAILS%%

## Output Language
%%LANGUAGE%%

## Requirements

Provide:
- **institution**: `{name, type, address:{city, street, province, postalCode}, rating:{value, count}}` — use only facts you know or are given; leave unknown fields empty.
- **doctors** (optional): 1-3 `{name, title, qualifications, specialties:[], languages:[]}`.
- **serviceTypes**: short list of service categories.

## Output Format (JSON)

```json
{
  "institution": {
    "name": "Institution name",
    "type": "institution type",
    "address": {"city": "", "street": "", "province": "", "postalCode": ""},
    "rating": {"value": 0, "count": 0}
  },
  "doctors": [
    {"name": "", "title": "", "qualifications": "", "specialties": [], "languages": []}
  ],
  "serviceTypes": ["service1", "service2"]
}
```
